        <referenceFunction amount="1.0" category="photovoltaic" datasetRelatesToProduct="true" generalComment="Production of photovoltaic thin film laminates. Deposition of nine thin-film layers on the triple-junction cell. The laminates ASR128 produced at United Solar have a size of 2.3 m2. The weight is 2.7 kg per m2. The rated nominal power is about 148Wp per laminate. The efficiency is estimated here for newer products with 6.5% at the beginning of the life time. Degradation has to be taken into account with achieved yields.;&#10;Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, amorphous silicon; &#10;UUID: 199fd835-7ade-3a6b-9117-03fde659a27d" includedProcesses="Electricity and heat use, materials, transport of materials, disposal of  wastes and the product. Data for direct air and water emissions were not available. It can be expected that small amount of NMVOC will be emitted from the lamination process." infrastructureProcess="true" localCategory="photovoltaic" localName="Photovoltaic laminate, a-Si, at plant" localSubCategory="production of components" name="Photovoltaic laminate, a-Si, at plant" subCategory="production of components" unit="m2"/>
